{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1210707001:0":{"text":"어이, 거기 너희들! 이리 와 봐!","source_cn":"站住！你们几个，过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A9927C59887CDD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210707002:0":{"text":"처음 보는 얼굴인데, 어디서 굴러먹던 녀석들이지?","source_cn":"我没见过你们，混哪条道上的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x984986CD73E3CFDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210707003:0":{"text":"아, 라이크 형님 아니십니까? 요즘 좀 어떠십니까?","source_cn":"啊，这不是我莱克大哥吗？最近手气怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBEAA7D622AA91C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210707004:0":{"text":"너는...?","source_cn":"你是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF106FBDC8E0BD674","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210707005:0":{"text":"신바입니다! 전에 같이 물쥐를 잡았잖습니까, 벌써 잊으셨어요? 그놈들한테 된통 당하신 적도 있잖아요?","source_cn":"辛巴！我们一起抓过水耗子的，忘了？您不是还被水耗子爬了脸？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B1A92E162DC3C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210707006:0":{"text":"...아! 그래! 그런 일이 있었지.","source_cn":"……哦！对！有这事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2896229E1FB702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210707007:0":{"text":"형님께서 구피를 좋아하셨던 게 기억나서 두 마리 가져왔는데, 갓 잡은 거라 아주 신선합니다.","source_cn":"我记得您喜欢吃孔雀鱼，我特意打了两条。您瞧刚出水的，可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3E308DE082E6B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210707008:0":{"text":"뭘 좀 아는 놈이군. 그런데 요즘 우리 조직이 경비를 강화해서 말이야. 절차를 밟긴 해야 돼. 어디 소속이야?","source_cn":"算你上道，但最近帮里抓的严，还是得走下流程，你混的哪条道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F507EE9DB659C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210707009:0":{"text":"하늘, 땅, 물, 귀신, 발길 닿는 모든 곳이 제 소속이죠.","source_cn":"天道地道水道鬼道，有哪条道混哪条道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12F33CDB53011456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210707010:0":{"text":"어떤 생선을 먹었지?","source_cn":"吃的什么鱼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0232CDFCF38C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210707011:0":{"text":"그게...","source_cn":"吃的是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CA832B5A5615AA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210707012:0":{"text":"넌 이미 대답했으니, 저들이 대답하도록 해.","source_cn":"你已经答过了，让他们几个回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A3A6681058550B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210707013:0":{"text":"너희는 어떤 생선을 먹었지?","source_cn":"你们吃的是什么鱼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C210850EA0568F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1210707013":{"text":"너희는 어떤 생선을 먹었지?","source_cn":"你们吃的是什么鱼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C210850EA0568F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210707014:0":{"text":"물귀신은 플래임테일을 먹지 않아. 너희는 블러디 로즈의 첩자가 틀림없군!","source_cn":"水鬼哪有吃焰尾鱼的，你们一定是血薇帮的探子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB9F730A76D0DB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"플래임테일","source_cn":"焰尾鱼","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE83DE548A100AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"플래임테일","female":"플래임테일","variant_male_record_index":"65868","variant_female_record_inde